# LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without this a fresh clone checks
# these files out as CRLF. That matters here more than in most repos: the
# Blender addon and the web Entity editor both regex-replace a block inside
# src/entities.js and write the file back, and the test suite asserts the
# round-trip is BYTE-identical. Both writers emit LF, so a CRLF checkout would
# turn every save into a whole-file diff and could fail smoke_roundtrip.
#
# The index is already all-LF, so this pins current behaviour rather than
# changing it.
* text=auto eol=lf
